  "slug": "the-point-restaurant-perdido",
  "name": "The Point Restaurant",
  "description": "The Point Restaurant dates back to the 1950's with fresh caught Mullet. In our 60 years of serving the best seafood around we've managed to perfect the southern seafood dining experience. From local Royal Reds, Oysters, and Crab Claws to Alligator Bites, Burgers and Bar Foods. Every evening at the Point you are sure to find Fresh Catch items, Chef Specials, and delicious desserts. The Courtyard features live bands and a full bar nestled under ancient oak trees with personal fireplaces, gathering style seating, picnic tables, and a stage. We feature bluegrass bands and other local bands on a regular nightly basis.",
